flowchart TD
    S[Source Code<br/>app/, nginx/, database/] --> D[Dockerfile]
    D -->|docker build| I[Image<br/>dockerized-app:latest]
    I -->|docker run / compose up| C[Container]

    C -->|depends_on healthy| DB[PostgreSQL container]
    C -->|proxy_pass| N[Nginx container]

    subgraph BUILD[CI Pipeline]
        S
        D
        I
    end

    subgraph TEST[Testing]
        HC{healthcheck passes?}
        I --> HC
        HC -- no --> STOP[Build fails — STOP]
    end

    subgraph RUN[Runtime]
        C --> N
        N -->|curl /health| OK{API responds 200?}
        OK -- yes --> LIVE[(Live)]
        OK -- no --> RB[Rollback<br/>compose down + checkout prev tag + up]
    end

    style STOP fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#b71c1c
    style RB fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#b71c1c
    style LIVE fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
